OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start, especially in
OL,6,Fthe north, however cloud will quickly
OL,7,Fmove in from the south. The cloud will
OL,8,Fproduce some spot of rain, with murky
OL,9,Fconditions over the hills. Winds
OL,10,Ffreshening later but a warm day for
OL,11,Fmost.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells this
OL,14,Fevening, before heavy rain sweeps
OL,15,Facross the region overnight,
OL,16,Faccompanied by strong winds for a
OL,17,Ftime. Remaining mild for late
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
